Negative control for client-notes.lookups.int.test.ts (AC-41 client-scope).

Drops the fixed `filter[clients.id]` URL scope from the contract-product lookup's
`targetUrl`. The guard re-stamps the whole search from `targetUrl`, so the outbound
`/contracts_products` request leaves the client's own resource unscoped. The
`filter[clients.id] === clientId` assertion in the bounded-search test goes red.

